             DR08, QDA5, DR08,
             BPI1, BPI2, BPI3H HD BPI3H BPI4, BPI5, 
             DR08H BPM DR08H, QFA6H QFA6H DR28,
             BPI6 HD BPI6 DR281 DR282 QFA8H VD QFA8H DR08H BPM DR08H, SHA, DR08,
             BPI7 HD DRCT MKC
